meta {
  name: Covariance Model
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/portfolio/covariance
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

params:query {
  ~symbols: NVDA,MSFT,AAPL
}

docs {
  Annualised volatilities plus the correlation matrix, with a `diagnostics` block naming the
  estimator, the number of aligned bars behind it, the Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage intensity, and
  which symbols fell back to the configured prior. `source` is one of prior / sample+prior /
  supplied — no number is ever returned without its provenance.
}
